  "n": 31,
  "texts": [
   "The best accessory",
   "for Claude",
   "is the Stream Deck.",
   "Now, by using",
   "Claude Code",
   "and the combination of",
   "the Stream Deck, you",
   "can literally just tell",
   "your Claude Code agent",
   "to look around for",
   "every single connected",
   "device on your network,",
   "whether it's your lights,",
   "your fridge,",
   "anything whatsoever,",
   "and to map all of",
   "the actions that you",
   "need to be doing",
   "directly to your",
   "Stream Deck buttons.",
   "Because what's even",
   "simpler than just telling",
   "AI to do something?",
   "Literally just",
   "clicking a button.",
   "Now follow for more",
   "AI news, videos, and",
   "tutorials each and",
   "every single day,",
   "and catch you",
   "in the next one."
